## (1) VERDICT (3 lines)

Nothing in semantic/ supports or contradicts the published STOP: the PPLX line never produced a single retrieval score (RT01 docs 615/662, zero queries encoded anywhere, scoring gate unpassable and never run).
All checkable logic re-verified from stored inputs (hashes 662/662, int8 0/677888 mismatches, packed exact, 21+4 tests pass); no published number rests on this code (NOT RUN / ABANDONED recorded consistently).
Deepest issues are a guarded latent trap (47 zero placeholders, MED), a declared-but-never-executed PCA96 transduction (LOW), and an unsourced "4.3 texts/s" figure (LOW) — none CRITICAL.

